{
  "_readme": [
    "Source registry for the dvaitavedanta.in extraction.",
    "",
    "Licensing: DVSRF publishes no explicit licence. Per PROJECT_STATUS.md",
    "convention #5 ('absence of a licence is not permission'), the project lead",
    "authorised this specific source for this specific non-commercial, educational",
    "use on 2026-08-15. That authorisation is recorded here and is written into",
    "source_note on every emitted data.json so the decision stays auditable.",
    "",
    "Seed URLs are the homepage links. Only the first path segment (contentId) is",
    "load-bearing: the ancestor id is not validated by the backend and the slugs",
    "are cosmetic. The route requires >=3 params, so 2-segment URLs 404.",
    "",
    "'slug' fixes the on-disk folder name. Where it is null the importer derives",
    "one from the discovered Devanagari title by transliteration and prints the",
    "mapping for review, so a run never blocks on a name we could not confirm.",
    "",
    "'layers' maps a Devanagari commentary heading to (folder, schema, author).",
    "Unknown headings are auto-slugged and default to grantha_tika_text; they are",
    "listed under unmapped_layers in _extract_status.json for follow-up."
  ],
  "site": {
    "name": "dvaitavedanta.in",
    "base": "https://dvaitavedanta.in",
    "url_pattern": "/category-details/{content_id}/{ancestor_id}/{slug}",
    "attribution": "Dvaita Vedanta Studies & Research Foundation",
    "license_note": "No published licence. Used with case-by-case permission granted by the project lead on 2026-08-15 for non-commercial, educational dharma-prachara use. Every record retains its source URL.",
    "user_agent": "DGE-DvaitaVedanta-Importer/1.0 (non-commercial; dharma-prachara; +https://tribhuvanachar.github.io/bhumandala)",
    "robots_txt": "absent (HTTP 404)",
    "sitemap": "absent (HTTP 404)",
    "notes": [
      "Fully server-rendered Laravel. No JS execution required.",
      "Container/section nodes: HTTP 200 with body 'No record found!!' -> skip.",
      "Nonexistent ids: HTTP 500, not 404 -> do not treat as fatal.",
      "Backend is slow on large granthas (nyaya_sudha timed out 3/3 during recon)",
      "because the full sidebar re-renders on every leaf. Use long timeouts."
    ]
  },
  "output_root": "data/darshana/vedanta/dvaita/DvaitaVedantaIn",
  "defaults": {
    "delay": 1.0,
    "timeout": 120,
    "retries": 4,
    "mula_schema": "grantha_mula_text",
